--TEST--
a name written where a property's type goes is offered the types a bare name reaches, read off the modifier in front of it because a written type is no node, `rule:ide/completion-offers-only-what-the-compiler-derived`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

class Money {}

class Cart {
    public Mon<|>
}
--REQUEST--
completion prefix=Mon
--EXPECT--
Money [Shop] class
